  "body": "One back from the beach, in a position that is always admired and rarely available.\r\n\r\nNorth-facing and constructed in concrete block and weatherboard on a freehold site, within one of the North Shore's most tightly held seaside enclaves. Combining timeless charm with quiet luxury, the expansive home unfolds into four bedrooms, three living spaces, swimming pool, and everything else you would expect from a home in one of Auckland's most coveted beachside pockets.\r\n\r\nContact Harry Richards to learn more",
